        </div>
        <div class="coffee-grid">
          <article class="coffee-card">
            <div class="coffee-image image-espresso" role="img" aria-label="Freshly brewed espresso in a ceramic cup"><span class="card-tag">THE CLASSIC</span><span class="coffee-number">01</span></div>
            <div class="coffee-info"><div><h3>Espresso Royale</h3><p>Deep chocolate, a velvety finish.</p></div><span class="price">₹180</span></div>
