        <p class="eyebrow">A TABLE FOR EVERYONE</p>
        <h2 id="about-title">Coffee is the<br><em>beginning,</em><br>not the whole story.</h2>
        <p>Since 2020, Brew Haven has been a place to linger a little longer. We work with trusted growers, make things fresh each day, and believe the best cup is the one shared with good company.</p>
        <p>Drop in to catch up, get a little work done, or simply enjoy a moment that’s just for you.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="about.html#team">Meet the people behind your cup <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <div class="about-stats">
          <div><strong>10k<span>+</span></strong><small>happy hellos</small></div>
          <div><strong>25<span>+</span></strong><small>ways to sip</small></div>
          <div><strong>4.9<span>★</span></strong><small>guest rating</small></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

