          <h2 id="reviews-title">Don't just take <em>our word.</em></h2>
          <p>Some of our favorite things are the stories you share with us.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="review-grid">
          <figure class="review-card"><div class="review-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“The best coffee experience in town. Every visit feels premium and welcoming.”</blockquote><figcaption><span class="avatar avatar-one">P</span><span><strong>Priya Sharma</strong><small>A regular since 2022</small></span><span class="quote-mark" aria-hidden="true">“</span></figcaption></figure>
          <figure class="review-card review-featured"><div class="review-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Perfect ambiance for work and meetings. Their Cold Brew Reserve is exceptional.”</blockquote><figcaption><span class="avatar avatar-two">R</span><span><strong>Rahul Mehta</strong><small>Cold brew enthusiast</small></span><span class="quote-mark" aria-hidden="true">“</span></figcaption></figure>
          <figure class="review-card"><div class="review-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Beautiful interiors, amazing coffee, and the kind of service that makes you stay.”</blockquote><figcaption><span class="avatar avatar-three">A</span><span><strong>Ananya Verma</strong><small>Here for the good vibes</small></span><span class="quote-mark" aria-hidden="true">“</span></figcaption></figure>
        </div>
      </div>
